        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, multicolumn radiator</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, multicolumn radiator
Disposal of a multicolumn radiator including thermostatic valve and mounting brackets or cantilevers;
UUID: 17dbfe84-e6c9-4048-adb3-db32c21997eb
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal parts are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, paint on metal to final disposal.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_17dbfe84-e6c9-4048-adb3-db32c21997eb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
